{"id": "000VIZ", "title": "H Labyrinth", "posted": "Heute, 01:46 Uhr", "author": "iEtsh", "rules": "H Labyrinth\n\nRULES\n\nNormal Sudoku\n\nNormal sudoku rules apply.\n\n7\n1\n6\n\nBouncing line\n\nDigits on every blue line path/branch must flow in a continuous ascending or descending order. However, hitting a 1 or a 9 breaks the flow and forces the opposite order to take over.\n\n(e.g., an ascending sequence like 3-6-7-9-6-2-1-3 will immediately turn into a descending one after the 9, and then flip back to ascending after the 1).\n\nKropki dots\n\nDigits separated by a black dot are in 1:2 ratio. Not all dots given.\n\n\u25b6 Solve Puzzle\n\nVisit Website for All Puzzles \u2197", "solutionCode": "Row 3", "difficulty": 2, "solvedCount": 6, "tags": ["Sudoku", "Kropki", "Kropki Pairs (Variante)"], "links": [{"url": "https://sudokupad.app/r544zk5sol", "kind": "sudokupad"}], "firstSeen": "2026-10-17T17:00:00+00:00", "data": "", "link": "https://sudokupad.app/r544zk5sol", "linkKind": "sudokupad", "settings": {}, "summary": {"format": "scl", "decoded": true, "rows": 9, "cols": 9, "cages": 0, "hasSolution": true, "features": ["lines", "overlays"]}}